'''Bora''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Cat Capsule#Rare Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]] increases health and damage. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]] increases health, damage, range, speed, slightly increases backswing and gives the ability to Weaken enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]].

